Spec: Portable .NET server lease boundary

Purpose:
  Verify standard signed authority independently from Windows IPC and backend transport implementation.

Structure:
  ./LinkGate.Authority: Agent-only typed authority and JWS verification.
  ./LinkGate.Authority.Tests: Independent verifier and owned cross-language orchestration.

Must:
  Production libraries depend on bounded public decoding and mature HTTP/TLS/JWS, never on Broker state or a transport executable; tests own source-built fixtures.
